# Repository ownership
#
# Bracket rules are evaluated in order; repo-wide it is deny-by-default, so the
# final "*" entry names the required reviewer.
#
# The branch ruleset on `main` requires a pull request. It does not require an
# approval count above zero, because the project currently has a single active
# maintainer and self-approval is not possible. When a second maintainer joins,
# raise the required approvals to 1 and drop the repository-admin bypass.

